<title>USA: Alden CSD, N.Y., won by  Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>Alden CSD, N.Y., won by  Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross Inc., said it won $7.710 million of Alden CSD, N.Y., school district bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.414 percent.</p>
